msgid ""
"It has been some time ago that changes in the Bible text were received from "
"the Cloud."
msgstr "Demek dirêj derbas bûye ku guhertinên di nivîsa Kitêba Pîroz de ji Cloud hatine wergirtin."

msgid ""
"This will right itself in a little time if you are connected to the Internet."
msgstr "Ev dê di demeke kurt de bi xwe rast bibe heke hûn bi înternetê ve girêdayî bin."

msgid "If not please do a Send/receive action."
msgstr "Heke na, ji kerema xwe çalakiya Şandin/Wergirtinê bikin."

msgid ""
"There are pending changes in the Bible text that have not yet been sent to "
"the Cloud for some time."
msgstr "Di nivîsa Kitêba Pîroz de guhertinên li bendê hene ku demeke dirêj e ji Cloud re nehatine şandin."

msgid "The Cloud already had some changes in this chapter."
msgstr "Cloud jixwe di vê beşê de hin guhertin hebûn."

msgid "You sent some changes for this chapter too."
msgstr "We jî ji bo vê beşê hin guhertin şandin."

msgid "The Cloud merged the two."
msgstr "Cloud herduyan yek kir."

msgid "Most likely this is okay."
msgstr "Dibe ku ev rast be."

msgid "You may want to check the result of the merge, whether it is correct."
msgstr "Dibe ku hûn bixwazin encama yekkirinê kontrol bikin, ka rast e."

msgid "You have now connected to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Niha hûn bi Bibledit Cloud ve girêdayî ne."

msgid ""
"While you were disconnected from Bibledit Cloud, you made some changes in "
"the Bible text on your device."
msgstr "Dema ku hûn ji Bibledit Cloud qut bûn, we di nivîsa Kitêba Pîroz de li ser cîhaza xwe hin guhertin kirin."

msgid "These changes will not be saved to Bibledit Cloud."
msgstr "Ev guhertin ê li Bibledit Cloud neyên tomarkirin."

msgid "The unsaved text is below."
msgstr "Nivîsa nehatiye tomarkirin li jêr e."

msgid ""
"While sending Bible text to Bibledit Cloud, you did not have write access to "
"this chapter."
msgstr "Dema nivîsa Kitêba Pîroz ji Bibledit Cloud re dihat şandin, we destûra nivîsandinê ya vê beşê tunebû."

msgid "You may want to check whether this is correct."
msgstr "Dibe ku hûn bixwazin kontrol bikin ka ev rast e."

msgid "Check whether Bible text was saved"
msgstr "Kontrol bike ka nivîsa Kitêba Pîroz hate tomarkirin"

msgid "Bibledit saved the Bible text below."
msgstr "Bibledit nivîsa Kitêba Pîroz a jêr tomar kir."

msgid "But Bibledit is not entirely sure that all went well."
msgstr "Lê Bibledit bi temamî ne piştrast e ku her tişt baş çû."

